Copyright 2026 wanghui

This product is a modified fork of ProcHub
(https://github.com/modstart-lib/prochub), Copyright modstart-lib
and the ProcHub contributors.

Significant changes from the upstream project:
- rebranded from ProcHub to AgentHub, with a new logo and application icons
- repositioned the product as a local toolbox for agent-driven workflows
- adopted surviving child processes by PID across application restarts
- persisted child stdout/stderr to files and streamed them into the UI
- removed upstream community and promotional content from the documentation

